# The repository is developed on Windows and deployed to Linux. Anything the
# demo host executes or parses must arrive with LF endings regardless of the
# checkout's core.autocrlf: a CRLF shell script fails with `$'\r': command not
# found`, and systemd and Caddy are no happier about the stray carriage return.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.service       text eol=lf
Caddyfile*      text eol=lf
